authentic experiences. Meals are hearty and varied, accommodating dietary needs with advance notice. Transportation in reliable 4x4 vehicles ensures access to prime viewing areas throughout the circuit, with your guide handling all logistics across the 6-day journey. The extended duration allows for more relaxed pacing, better wildlife photography opportunities, and deeper immersion in each ecosystem compared to shorter itineraries.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This affordable comprehensive safari 2026 is perfect for first-time visitors wanting thorough exposure, wildlife enthusiasts seeking maximum diversity, photography enthusiasts needing varied subjects (predators, flamingos, elephants with mountain backdrops), or travelers wanting the definitive Kenya safari experience without luxury pricing. The 6-day duration provides ideal balance between comprehensive coverage and practical time commitment, making it one of our most popular extended budget safaris for those wanting to experience Kenya's wildlife highlights thoroughly.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Booking requires planning due to the circuit's complexity. We recommend advance booking (2-3 months for peak season) to secure preferred dates and accommodations across three parks. Customizations, focused interests (birdwatching, photography, etc.), and group rates are available upon request with sufficient notice, though the standard itinerary already provides excellent coverage for most travelers.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}