    VALUES ($j$Kenya's Best 10 Days Budget Safari 2026$j$, $j$Ultimate Kenya safari covering five premier parks over ten days. Maximum wildlife diversity including Big Five, Special Five, flamingos, hippos. Shared groups, comprehensive experience. From $3190.$j$, $j${"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "direction": "ltr", "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Experience the definitive Kenyan wildlife adventure with our ultimate 10-Day Kenya's Best Budget Safari 2026. This comprehensive itinerary, starting from $3190 per person, represents the most extensive coverage of Kenya's premier wildlife destinations available at budget-conscious pricing, offering maximum wildlife diversity, extended exploration time, and complete ecosystem exposure across the country's most iconic parks. From the predator-rich savannahs of Masai Mara to the flamingo-filled shores of Lake Nakuru, the hippo-populated waters of Lake Naivasha, the elephant herds of Amboseli with Kilimanjaro backdrop, and the unique Special Five of Samburu - this tour showcases Kenya's complete ecological spectrum in one unforgettable extended itinerary. Perfect for serious wildlife enthusiasts, comprehensive first-time visitors, photography enthusiasts seeking maximum subject variety, or travelers wanting the definitive African safari experience without luxury costs, this 10-day adventure represents exceptional value for those wanting thorough exposure to why Kenya remains Africa's premier safari destination.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your extended journey begins with strategic sequencing that optimizes wildlife experiences while managing travel logistics. The 10-day duration allows for proper acclimatization, relaxed pacing, thorough exploration, and meaningful immersion in each ecosystem rather than rushed visits. This extended timeframe transforms the safari from tourist overview to meaningful engagement with Kenya's wildlife diversity, conservation challenges, and ecological wonders. Each destination receives sufficient time for comprehensive game viewing, photographic opportunities, educational understanding, and personal connection that shorter itineraries cannot provide.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Masai Mara National Reserve forms the substantial first chapter with multiple days allowing for pattern recognition, behavioral observation, and comprehensive Big Five tracking. Unlike shorter visits that provide snapshot experiences, extended time enables understanding of predator-prey relationships, migration dynamics (seasonal), and ecosystem interactions that define this iconic reserve. Your guides utilize the additional days for sophisticated tracking, individual animal recognition, and strategic positioning based on learned patterns rather than basic tourist routes.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "The northern addition of Samburu National Reserve represents a significant enhancement over standard southern circuits. This unique ecosystem, with its Special Five species found nowhere else in Kenya, adds completely different wildlife experiences, landscapes, and cultural interactions. The extended itinerary allows proper travel time to this remote region and sufficient exploration to appreciate its distinct ecology rather than token inclusion. The contrast between Samburu's arid northern environment and southern parks demonstrates Kenya's remarkable biodiversity within single-country geography.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lake ecosystems receive dedicated attention with both alkaline (Nakuru) and freshwater (Naivasha) experiences included. The extended time allows for proper appreciation of each lake's unique ecology rather than rushed visits. At Lake Nakuru, you have opportunities for comprehensive flamingo viewing, rhino tracking, and birdwatching across multiple sessions. At Lake Naivasha, included boat safaris and optional walking experiences provide aquatic and terrestrial perspectives impossible in national parks. This dual lake inclusion showcases Kenya's Rift Valley diversity beyond savannah ecosystems.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Amboseli National Park provides the iconic elephant and Kilimanjaro experiences that complete the Kenyan wildlife portfolio. Extended time increases probabilities of clear mountain views, comprehensive elephant herd observations, and photographic optimization. The additional days also allow for exploration beyond standard tourist circuits, potentially including less-visited park sectors or specialized interests like birdwatching or landscape photography.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This ultimate budget safari 2026 represents exceptional value at $3190. While significantly more expensive than shorter options, the comprehensive coverage, extended time, reduced daily travel pressure, and maximum wildlife diversity justify the investment for serious travelers. The shared group model (4-12 travelers) distributes costs while maintaining social experiences. By combining five premier destinations with sufficient time in each, this safari delivers experiences approaching private or specialized tours at budget-conscious pricing.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Educational opportunities are unparalleled in this comprehensive itinerary. Learn about savannah ecology in Mara, desert adaptations in Samburu, lake ecosystems at Nakuru and Naivasha, elephant behavior in Amboseli, and conservation approaches across different park types. Cultural interactions span multiple ethnic groups (Maasai in south, Samburu in north) providing comparative anthropological perspectives. This comprehensive educational approach fosters deep understanding of Kenya's ecological and cultural complexity rather than superficial tourism.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Photography benefits immensely from extended time and destination variety. Instead of rushed shots at standard locations, you have opportunities for different subjects (predators, flamingos, hippos, elephants, northern specialties), various landscapes (savannah, desert, lakes, mountain), multiple lighting conditions across days, and patient waiting for behavioral moments. The comprehensive coverage builds complete Kenyan wildlife portfolios impossible on shorter trips.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Practical advantages of extended duration include reduced daily travel distances through better sequencing, proper rest between long drives, opportunity for laundry and organization days, better acclimatization to safari rhythms, and relaxed pacing that enhances enjoyment rather than exhaustion. The additional cost is offset by reduced per-day expenses through longer stay efficiencies and the invaluable benefit of comprehensive Kenyan experiences.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This ultimate safari 2026 is perfect for serious wildlife enthusiasts wanting complete Kenyan exposure, photography enthusiasts building comprehensive portfolios, first-time visitors with sufficient time wanting thorough introduction, repeat visitors seeking new regions beyond standard circuits, or travelers with singular African opportunities wanting maximum experiences. The 10-day duration represents optimal balance between comprehensive coverage and practical time commitment for thorough Kenyan exploration.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Booking requires advance planning (4-6 months recommended) due to comprehensive logistics across multiple regions. We assist with itinerary customization based on specific interests, seasonal considerations, and practical arrangements. Group compatibility considerations are more important given extended shared travel.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Don't miss this ultimate opportunity for comprehensive Kenyan wildlife experiences at budget-conscious pricing. Whether seeking maximum destination coverage, complete photographic portfolios, thorough ecological understanding, or simply the definitive African safari adventure, this 10-day Kenya's Best budget safari delivers unparalleled experiences across Kenya's premier wildlife destinations. Book now for your 2026 expedition and discover why Kenya represents Africa's ultimate safari diversity.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "heading", "tag": "h2", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Good to know", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Departures: Weekly from Nairobi", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Group size: 4-12 people", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}]}}$j$::jsonb, $j$Kenya's Best 10 Days Budget Safari 2026$j$, $j$Book Kenya's Best 10-day budget safari 2026 from $3190. Ultimate comprehensive tour covering five premier parks including Masai Mara, Samburu, Nakuru, Naivasha, Amboseli.$j$, 'en', v);
      SELECT row_number() OVER (ORDER BY sort_order, id), v, md5(v::text || 'price' || id::text), id, 319000, 319000, 319000, 319000 FROM seasons;
  END IF;
END $do$;
-- budget-tours-data.ts: 3-day-masai-mara-budget-safari
DO $do$ DECLARE v int; BEGIN
  IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM tours WHERE slug = $j$3-day-masai-mara-budget-safari$j$) THEN
    VALUES ($j$3-day-masai-mara-budget-safari$j$, false, true, false, false,
      (SELECT id FROM templates WHERE variant = $j$budget$j$::enum_templates_variant ORDER BY id LIMIT 1),
      (SELECT id FROM destinations WHERE slug = $j$kenya$j$),
      3, (SELECT id FROM media WHERE url = $j$/masai-mara-safari.jpg$j$ ORDER BY id LIMIT 1),
      NULL, 4, 7) RETURNING id INTO v;
    VALUES ($j$3-Day Masai Mara Budget Safari 2026$j$, $j$Affordable 3-day Masai Mara safari featuring Big Five game drives, budget camp accommodation, shared group experience. Perfect short wildlife adventure from Nairobi. From $790.$j$, $j${"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "direction": "ltr", "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Experience the magic of Africa's most iconic wildlife reserve with our 3-Day Masai Mara Budget Safari 2026. Starting from just $790 per person, this condensed yet comprehensive safari delivers maximum wildlife experiences in minimal time, perfect for travelers with limited schedules or those wanting to add a safari component to a broader Kenyan itinerary. Masai Mara National Reserve, Kenya's crown jewel of wildlife destinations, offers unparalleled game viewing with its vast savannah landscapes, abundant predator populations, and the famous seasonal Great Migration (July-October). Our carefully crafted 3-day itinerary optimizes your limited time with strategic game drives, comfortable budget accommodations, and professional guiding that ensures you experience the essence of the Mara.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your adventure begins with an early departure from Nairobi, traveling through Kenya's scenic Great Rift Valley with panoramic views that provide your first taste of Africa's dramatic landscapes. The journey to Masai Mara itself becomes part of the experience, passing through traditional Maasai villages and witnessing the transition from urban to wilderness environments. Arriving at your budget camp by midday, you'll have time to settle in before embarking on your first afternoon game drive - strategically timed for optimal wildlife viewing when temperatures cool and animals become more active. This initial game drive introduces you to the Mara's ecosystem, with opportunities to spot elephants, giraffes, zebras, and potentially predators beginning their evening hunts.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Day two represents the core of your Masai Mara experience with a full day of game viewing in the reserve. Unlike shorter safaris that rush through the experience, our full-day approach allows for comprehensive exploration of different sectors of the vast reserve. With packed lunches, you can venture further from tourist circuits, increasing your chances of unique wildlife sightings and undisturbed photographic opportunities. Your guide's expertise becomes particularly valuable today as they track animal movements, interpret behaviors, and position your vehicle for optimal viewing of potential predator-prey interactions. The extended time also allows for patient observation at waterholes or known lion territories - experiences impossible on rushed itineraries.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Our 3-day format provides balanced safari experience: enough time for meaningful wildlife encounters without overwhelming first-time safari-goers. The itinerary includes approximately 12-15 hours of dedicated game drives across multiple sessions (afternoon, full day, morning), providing comprehensive exposure to the Mara's wildlife diversity. This concentrated approach ensures you experience the reserve's key highlights - from the Big Five (lion, leopard, elephant, buffalo, rhino) to abundant herbivores, predators, and over 450 bird species that call the Mara home.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Budget accommodations at Rhino Tourist Camp or similar offer comfortable safari experience without luxury frills. These camps provide essential amenities - secure accommodations, hot showers, proper beds, and dining facilities - while maintaining authentic safari atmosphere. The shared group model (4-7 travelers per vehicle) makes this safari exceptionally affordable while fostering social travel experiences. Despite the budget pricing, we maintain quality standards with well-maintained 4x4 vehicles featuring pop-up roofs for optimal viewing and photography.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This safari represents exceptional value at $790, approximately 30% below typical 3-day Masai Mara tours. Cost savings come from strategic partnerships with budget camps, efficient group sizes, and eliminating unnecessary inclusions. Yet we preserve the essential safari experiences: extensive game drives, professional guiding, comfortable accommodations, and comprehensive park access. The price includes all major expenses (transport, accommodation, meals, park fees, guiding), providing transparent budgeting without hidden costs.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Practical advantages include weekly departures year-round (with best wildlife viewing July-October during migration), seamless Nairobi pickup/dropoff, and minimal pre-travel preparation requirements. The condensed timeline makes this safari accessible to business travelers, stopover visitors, or those combining safari with beach holidays. Despite the short duration, the itinerary delivers concentrated wildlife experiences that often exceed expectations.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Photography opportunities abound even on this brief safari. The Mara's open landscapes provide excellent lighting conditions, while abundant wildlife offers diverse subjects. Our vehicles' pop-up roofs allow for stable photography from elevated positions. The full-day game drive provides multiple lighting conditions (morning golden hour, midday brightness, afternoon warmth) for varied photographic results.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "For first-time safari-goers, this 3-day introduction provides manageable exposure to determine if longer safaris suit your interests. For experienced travelers, it offers a cost-effective Masai Mara fix between other adventures. For all visitors, it delivers the quintessential African wildlife experience in accessible, affordable format.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Booking is straightforward with immediate confirmation for most departure dates. We recommend booking 2-3 months in advance for peak season (July-October) or 2-4 weeks for other periods. Solo travelers benefit from shared accommodation arrangements (same-gender room sharing) avoiding single supplements.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Don't miss this opportunity to experience Africa's most famous wildlife reserve at unprecedented budget pricing. Whether seeking introductory safari experience, photographic opportunities, or simply the thrill of witnessing wild animals in their natural habitat, our 3-Day Masai Mara Budget Safari delivers unforgettable experiences at accessible cost. Book now for 2026 departure and discover why Masai Mara remains the world's premier safari destination.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "heading", "tag": "h2", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Good to know", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Departures: Weekly from Nairobi (Mon, Wed, Fri)", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Group size: 4-7 people", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}]}}$j$::jsonb, $j$3-Day Masai Mara Budget Safari 2026$j$, $j$Book 3-day Masai Mara budget safari 2026 from $790. Big Five game drives, budget camp accommodation, shared group experience. Weekly departures from Nairobi.$j$, 'en', v);
      SELECT row_number() OVER (ORDER BY sort_order, id), v, md5(v::text || 'price' || id::text), id, 79000, 79000, 79000, 79000 FROM seasons;
  END IF;
END $do$;
-- budget-tours-data.ts: 6-day-masai-mara-nakuru-amboseli-budget-safari
DO $do$ DECLARE v int; BEGIN
  IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM tours WHERE slug = $j$6-day-masai-mara-nakuru-amboseli-budget-safari$j$) THEN
    VALUES ($j$6-day-masai-mara-nakuru-amboseli-budget-safari$j$, false, true, false, false,
      (SELECT id FROM templates WHERE variant = $j$budget$j$::enum_templates_variant ORDER BY id LIMIT 1),
      (SELECT id FROM destinations WHERE slug = $j$kenya$j$),
      6, (SELECT id FROM media WHERE url = $j$/amboseli_elephants_at_sun_set-2__1200w.jpg$j$ ORDER BY id LIMIT 1),
      NULL, 4, 10) RETURNING id INTO v;
    VALUES ($j$6-Day Masai Mara, Nakuru & Amboseli Budget Safari 2026$j$, $j$Classic 6-day Kenya safari circuit visiting Masai Mara, Lake Nakuru, and Amboseli. Big Five, flamingos, elephants with Kilimanjaro backdrop. Budget group tour from $1490.$j$, $j${"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "direction": "ltr", "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Experience the classic Kenyan safari circuit with our comprehensive 6-Day Masai Mara, Nakuru & Amboseli Budget Safari 2026. Starting from just $1490 per person, this balanced itinerary combines Kenya's most iconic wildlife destinations into one affordable package, offering diverse ecosystems, maximum wildlife variety, and efficient travel logistics. Masai Mara delivers the quintessential African savannah experience with abundant predators and the seasonal Great Migration spectacle. Lake Nakuru provides the unique alkaline lake ecosystem famous for its pink flamingo carpets and rhino sanctuary. Amboseli completes the circuit with its signature elephant herds roaming against the stunning backdrop of Mount Kilimanjaro. This 6-day journey represents the perfect balance between comprehensive coverage and manageable duration for travelers wanting substantial Kenyan wildlife experiences without extended time commitments.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your adventure begins with strategic travel sequencing that minimizes long drives while maximizing wildlife viewing. Day one transitions you from Nairobi to Masai Mara with an afternoon arrival allowing for immediate game viewing rather than wasted travel time. The Mara receives dedicated attention with two full days of game drives, ensuring comprehensive exploration rather than rushed visits. This extended time increases your chances of witnessing predator-prey interactions, observing animal behaviors, and capturing photographic moments in Africa's most photogenic landscape. Unlike shorter itineraries that treat Masai Mara as a brief stop, our allocation of substantial time respects the reserve's significance and provides proper safari immersion.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lake Nakuru National Park serves as both wildlife destination and strategic transit point, breaking the journey between Masai Mara and Amboseli. The park's compact size allows for concentrated wildlife viewing in limited time - a perfect complement to the expansive Mara. Here you'll experience completely different ecosystems: the alkaline lake attracting thousands of flamingos (seasonal) and pelicans, the fever tree forests providing habitat for both black and white rhinos, and the savannah woodlands home to giraffes, buffaloes, and diverse antelope species. The contrast between Nakuru's lake-focused ecosystem and Mara's open savannah demonstrates Kenya's remarkable biodiversity within relatively short distances.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Amboseli National Park provides the dramatic third act with its iconic elephant herds and Kilimanjaro views. The journey from Nakuru to Amboseli traverses diverse Kenyan landscapes, from the Rift Valley floor to the agricultural highlands to the arid plains at Kilimanjaro's base. Arrival timing maximizes your Amboseli experience with afternoon game drives upon arrival and full exploration the following day. The park's open plains and reliable elephant populations guarantee spectacular wildlife viewing, while clear weather (most common early mornings) provides those postcard-perfect Kilimanjaro photographs that define East African safari imagery.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This 6-day circuit represents exceptional value at $1490, approximately 25-30% below similar offerings while maintaining quality experiences. Cost efficiencies come from strategic camp selections, shared group transport, and elimination of luxury elements unnecessary for authentic safari enjoyment. The price includes all major expenses: park fees (approximately $350-400 value), all meals, professional guiding, comfortable budget accommodations, and comprehensive transportation across three diverse regions. This transparent pricing eliminates surprise costs while delivering complete safari experiences.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Practical advantages of this itinerary include balanced travel distances, sufficient time in each destination, logical geographical progression, and manageable duration for most travelers. The 6-day format provides substantial safari experience without excessive time commitment, making it ideal for first-time visitors wanting comprehensive Kenyan introduction, repeat visitors focusing on key highlights, or those combining safari with other Kenyan activities like beach holidays or business engagements. Weekly departures ensure flexibility, while shared group dynamics (4-10 travelers) foster social experiences at budget-friendly pricing.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Photography opportunities are exceptional across all three destinations. Masai Mara offers predator action and vast landscapes, Lake Nakuru provides unique bird concentrations and rhino close-ups, while Amboseli delivers the iconic elephant-with-Kilimanjaro compositions that define African wildlife photography. The extended time allows for varied lighting conditions, patient waiting for behavioral moments, and multiple opportunities for each photographic subject rather than rushed attempts.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Educational value spans multiple ecosystems: savannah ecology in Mara, lake ecosystem dynamics at Nakuru, and elephant behavior studies in Amboseli. Each park presents distinct conservation challenges and successes - from rhino protection at Nakuru to human-wildlife coexistence in Amboseli to migration corridor preservation in Mara. Our guides provide context that transforms wildlife viewing into meaningful understanding of Kenya's conservation landscape.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Budget accommodations at carefully selected camps maintain comfort standards while preserving authentic safari atmosphere. Properties like Rhino Tourist Camp (Mara), Buraha Zenoni (Nakuru), and Manjaro Tented Camp (Amboseli) offer secure accommodations, hot showers, proper dining facilities, and strategic locations near park gates. The shared group model reduces costs while fostering camaraderie among like-minded travelers.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This safari is particularly suitable for first-time Kenya visitors wanting comprehensive introduction, wildlife enthusiasts seeking varied ecosystems, photography enthusiasts building diverse portfolios, or travelers with one-week availability wanting maximum experiences. The balanced itinerary avoids excessive travel fatigue while delivering substantial wildlife diversity across Kenya's premier parks.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Booking requires 2-4 months advance planning for peak season (July-October) or 2-6 weeks for other periods. We assist with pre-safari preparations, packing guidance, and logistical arrangements. Solo travelers benefit from shared room arrangements avoiding single supplements, while families enjoy child-friendly accommodations and activities.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Don't miss this classic Kenyan safari experience at unprecedented budget pricing. Whether seeking comprehensive wildlife introduction, photographic diversity, or simply the thrill of Africa's most iconic landscapes, our 6-Day Masai Mara, Nakuru & Amboseli Budget Safari delivers unforgettable experiences across Kenya's premier destinations. Book now for 2026 departure and discover why this circuit remains Kenya's most popular safari route.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "heading", "tag": "h2", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Good to know", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Departures: Weekly from Nairobi (Every Monday & Friday)", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Group size: 4-10 people", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}]}}$j$::jsonb, $j$6-Day Masai Mara, Nakuru & Amboseli Budget Safari 2026$j$, $j$Book 6-day Masai Mara Nakuru Amboseli budget safari 2026 from $1490. Classic Kenya circuit with Big Five, flamingos, elephants, and Kilimanjaro views. Shared group tour.$j$, 'en', v);
      SELECT row_number() OVER (ORDER BY sort_order, id), v, md5(v::text || 'price' || id::text), id, 149000, 149000, 149000, 149000 FROM seasons;
  END IF;
END $do$;
-- budget-tours-data.ts: 5-day-masai-mara-naivasha-amboseli-budget-safari
DO $do$ DECLARE v int; BEGIN
  IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM tours WHERE slug = $j$5-day-masai-mara-naivasha-amboseli-budget-safari$j$) THEN
    VALUES ($j$5-day-masai-mara-naivasha-amboseli-budget-safari$j$, false, true, false, false,
      (SELECT id FROM templates WHERE variant = $j$budget$j$::enum_templates_variant ORDER BY id LIMIT 1),
      (SELECT id FROM destinations WHERE slug = $j$kenya$j$),
      5, (SELECT id FROM media WHERE url = $j$/ostrich_family_in_amboseli-2__1200w.jpg$j$ ORDER BY id LIMIT 1),
      NULL, 4, 8) RETURNING id INTO v;
    VALUES ($j$5-Day Masai Mara, Naivasha & Amboseli Budget Safari 2026$j$, $j$5-day Kenya safari visiting Masai Mara, Lake Naivasha, and Amboseli. Big Five game drives, boat safari with hippos, elephants with Kilimanjaro. Budget group tour from $1190.$j$, $j${"root": {"type": "root", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1, "direction": "ltr", "children": [{"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Discover Kenya's diverse ecosystems with our perfectly balanced 5-Day Masai Mara, Naivasha & Amboseli Budget Safari 2026. Starting from just $1190 per person, this itinerary offers the ideal combination of savannah wildlife, freshwater lake experiences, and iconic mountain landscapes in one affordable package. Masai Mara provides the classic African safari experience with its abundant predators and vast herds. Lake Naivasha introduces aquatic wildlife with included boat safaris offering close-up hippo viewing and birdwatching opportunities. Amboseli completes the journey with its signature elephant herds roaming beneath Africa's highest peak. This 5-day adventure represents smart safari planning - delivering maximum diversity in manageable timeframe while avoiding excessive travel distances that plague longer circuits.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Your journey begins with efficient travel to Masai Mara, Kenya's most famous wildlife reserve. Rather than wasting precious daylight on lengthy travel, we optimize departure times to ensure afternoon game drives upon arrival. This immediate immersion in the Mara ecosystem sets the tone for your safari experience. The reserve receives focused attention with dedicated game drives across two sessions, allowing comprehensive exploration of different sectors. Unlike rushed single-day visits, our allocation of substantial Mara time increases wildlife sighting probabilities, provides opportunities for behavioral observation, and respects the significance of this iconic destination. Your guide's expertise becomes particularly valuable here as they interpret animal behaviors, track predator movements, and position your vehicle for optimal viewing and photography.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Lake Naivasha serves as both wildlife destination and strategic transit point between Mara and Amboseli. The lake's freshwater ecosystem provides completely different wildlife experiences from the savannah parks. Included boat safaris offer unique perspectives impossible on land-based game drives - close encounters with hippo pods, water bird colonies, and aquatic adaptations. Optional walking safaris at Crescent Island (additional cost) allow for rare pedestrian wildlife viewing in safe environments. This lake interlude also provides practical benefits: breaking the long journey between parks, offering relaxation opportunities, and introducing different accommodation styles with lakeside settings.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Amboseli National Park delivers the dramatic finale with its world-famous elephant herds and Kilimanjaro backdrop. The journey from Naivasha to Amboseli traverses Kenya's agricultural heartland before descending to the arid plains at Kilimanjaro's base. Arrival timing maximizes your Amboseli experience with afternoon exploration upon arrival and comprehensive game viewing the following day. The park's reliable elephant populations, combined with clear weather conditions (most common at dawn), provide those iconic African safari photographs that define bucket-list travel experiences. Amboseli's compact size ensures concentrated wildlife viewing, making every game drive productive and memorable.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This 5-day safari represents exceptional value at $1190, approximately 25% below similar offerings while maintaining quality standards. Strategic cost management comes from: shared group transport (4-8 travelers), carefully selected budget accommodations, elimination of luxury elements unnecessary for authentic experiences, and volume-based partnerships with camps and parks. The transparent price includes all major expenses: park fees (approximately $250-300 value), all meals, professional guiding, boat safari, comfortable accommodations, and comprehensive transportation. This eliminates surprise costs while delivering complete safari experiences.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Practical advantages include: efficient travel routing minimizing backtracking, balanced time allocation across destinations, manageable duration for most travelers, and logical geographical progression. The 5-day format provides substantial safari experience without overwhelming first-timers or requiring extensive time commitments, making it ideal for those combining safari with other Kenyan activities, business travelers with limited availability, or first-time visitors wanting comprehensive introduction. Weekly departures ensure flexibility, while shared group dynamics foster social experiences at budget-friendly pricing.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Photography opportunities span diverse subjects: predator action and sweeping landscapes in Mara, hippo close-ups and aquatic scenes at Naivasha, elephant herds with mountain backdrops in Amboseli. The varied environments provide different lighting conditions, compositional opportunities, and subject matter for building comprehensive photographic portfolios. Extended time in each location allows for patient waiting, behavioral observation, and multiple attempts at capturing perfect moments rather than rushed snapshots.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Educational value covers multiple ecosystems: savannah ecology in Mara, freshwater lake dynamics at Naivasha, and elephant behavior in Amboseli. Each destination presents distinct conservation stories - from predator protection in Mara to human-wildlife coexistence around Naivasha to elephant research in Amboseli. Our guides provide context transforming wildlife viewing into meaningful understanding of Kenya's environmental challenges and successes.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Budget accommodations at strategically located camps maintain comfort while preserving safari authenticity. Properties like Rhino Tourist Camp (Mara), Leisure Apex Hotel (Naivasha), and Manjaro Tented Camp (Amboseli) offer secure accommodations, hot showers, dining facilities, and proximity to wildlife areas. The shared group model reduces individual costs while creating camaraderie among travelers.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "This safari suits: first-time Kenya visitors wanting diverse introduction, wildlife enthusiasts seeking varied ecosystems, photography enthusiasts building portfolios, travelers with one-week availability, or those wanting Masai Mara plus additional experiences. The itinerary avoids excessive travel fatigue while delivering substantial wildlife diversity across three distinct environments.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Booking requires 1-3 months advance planning for peak season (July-October) or 2-6 weeks for other periods. We assist with preparations, packing guidance, and logistical arrangements. Solo travelers benefit from shared room arrangements, while families appreciate child-friendly activities and accommodations.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Don't miss this perfectly balanced Kenyan safari at unprecedented budget pricing. Whether seeking diverse wildlife experiences, photographic variety, or simply the quintessential African adventure, our 5-Day Masai Mara, Naivasha & Amboseli Budget Safari delivers unforgettable memories across Kenya's premier destinations. Book now for 2026 departure and discover why this combination represents smart safari planning.", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "heading", "tag": "h2", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Good to know", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Departures: Weekly from Nairobi (Every Wednesday & Saturday)", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}, {"type": "paragraph", "children": [{"type": "text", "text": "Group size: 4-8 people", "detail": 0, "format": 0, "mode": "normal", "style": "", "version": 1}], "direction": "ltr", "format": "", "indent": 0, "textFormat": 0, "version": 1}]}}$j$::jsonb, $j$5-Day Masai Mara, Naivasha & Amboseli Budget Safari 2026$j$, $j$Book 5-day Masai Mara Naivasha Amboseli budget safari 2026 from $1190. Big Five game drives, Lake Naivasha boat safari with hippos, Amboseli elephants and Kilimanjaro views.$j$, 'en', v);
      SELECT row_number() OVER (ORDER BY sort_order, id), v, md5(v::text || 'price' || id::text), id, 119000, 119000, 119000, 119000 FROM seasons;
  END IF;
END $do$;


